 He has already guided [to the faith] before making entirely clear to them what they should avoid. God has knowledge of everything;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(for) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِيُضِلَّ","en_gloss":"that He lets go astray","transliteration":"liyuḍilla","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَوْمًۢا","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"[when]","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هَدَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"He has guided them","transliteration":"hadāhum","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُبَيِّنَ","en_gloss":"He makes clear","transliteration":"yubayyina","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَتَّقُونَ ۚ","en_gloss":"they should fear","transliteration":"yattaqūna","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"(of) every","transliteration":"bikulli","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":17,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"9:115"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١١٥","en_gloss":"(115)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:115"}]},{"verse_key":"9:116","surah":9,"ayah":116,"ar_uthmani":"إِ